  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "自動光學檢測",
    "sub_ename": "AUTOMATIC OPTICAL INSPECTION",
    "describe_ch": "此課程將教導學生有關於自動光學檢測的基本觀念及原則，譬如影像處理技術、型樣識別技術、幾何學量測技術以及最後要會舉例出自動光學檢測在自動工業上之應用等等。包含影像處理應用程式及影像多媒體，影像壓縮，自動光學檢測整合系統架構，C++基本程式設計、光學介面技術、自動光學檢測系統之機構、CCD感測器、影像驅動器與致動器應用，並針對影像處理應用、自動光學檢測整合個案加以分析。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is to provide students with the basic concepts, principles of optical automatic inspection, the image processing technologies, the pattern identification, the measurements of geometry, and the applications of optical automatic inspection on automation industries. The course will provide practical instruction in experimental optical automatic inspection techniques, the analysis of image data and the treatment of random errors. Students will also benefit by gaining useful information on a variety of background topics including multimedia, image compression, optical automatic inspection system, signal processing, electricity and geometrical optics, C++,CCD sensor, image driver, together with the recording and analysis of results and the use of Window operation System. During the Optical automatic inspection Interface Design demo classes, a demonstrator is always available for guidance and help.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "1.能瞭解自動光學檢測的基本元件",
      "describe_en": "be familiar with the essential elements of computer and optical automatic inspection systems. \r\n\r\n"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "2.能完成一自動光學檢測系統的相關應用。",
      "describe_en": "have a knowledge of the performance of commercial vision systems. \r\n\r\n"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "3. 能評估自動光學檢測系統所獲資訊的適用性",
      "describe_en": "be able to evaluate emerging computer and optical automatic inspection technologies."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "4.能利用自動光學檢測系統的原理，評估一產品或系統，並提出可行驗證方法",
      "describe_en": "4.Use principles of automatic and integrated electromechanical system to evaluate a product or system and propose a feasible method for validation."
    }
  ],
